  "boundary":"This programme discovers H-prefixed FDA HDE application and supplement decision records from the openFDA PMA data surface. Exact APPR supports a scoped HDE approval/marketing-authorization record for the corresponding application or supplement. HDE approval is not a reasonable-assurance-of-effectiveness finding: the HDE pathway is exempt from that effectiveness showing and uses a probable-benefit/risk standard. The record also does not by itself establish facility-specific IRB approval, global authorization, exact current commercial configuration, all-configuration conformance, automatic assessment reopening, or UNESCO/institutional endorsement."
